• US HR Operations – Onboarding, Employee relations and Payroll. </div> <div>  <div style="clear: both;display: table;"> <label style="font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:3px;"><b>Industry : </b></label> <span style="display:inline-block;width:500px">Courier / Logistics</span> </div>   <div style="clear: both;display: table;"> <label style="font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:3px;"><b>Functional Area : </b></label> <span style="display:inline-block;width:500px">Human Resources</span> </div>   <div> <label style="font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:3px;"><b>Role : </b></label> <span style="display:inline-block;width:500px">HR Operations - Other</span> </div>  </div> </div> <div style="margin-bottom:30px;">  <div style="font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:10px;color:#F79647;">WORK EXPERIENCE</div>  <div style="margin-bottom:15px;"> <div style="margin-bottom:3px;">  <span style="font-weight:bold;">Onboarding Specialist</span>   <span style="color:#A6A6A5;">Jan '25 - till date</span>  </div>  <div style="color:#4E81BD;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:3px;">Advatix Apac Logistics</div>   HR Operations and US Onboarding professional with 5 years of experience in end-to-end employee and contractor onboarding, HR compliance, documentation, background screening, and client relationship management for US-based clients.

Experienced in managing I-9 verification, E-Verify, background checks, drug screening, health screening, and onboarding processes for C2C, Independent Contractor (IC), and W-2/T4 engagements. Proficient in coordinating with clients, MSPs, internal stakeholders, and legal teams to ensure compliance, accuracy, and timely onboarding.

Hands-on experience with JobDiva, UKG, Beeline, and IQN, along with exposure to Workday. Skilled in managing multiple client requirements, resolving onboarding issues, maintaining documentation accuracy, training new employees, and supporting team performance.

Have worked with 30+ clients, trained 10–15 new employees, and taken on team-lead responsibilities. Recognized for strong performance and a consistent approach to service delivery.

